---
// src/components/Comparison.astro - Comparativa operativa «Uno a uno» vs «DECA Light»
---

<section class="comparison-section" aria-labelledby="comparison-title">
  <div class="container comparison-container" data-reveal="card">
    <header class="comparison-header">
      <h2 id="comparison-title" class="comparison-title">
        La misma mañana, de dos maneras.
      </h2>
    </header>

    <div class="comparison-table-wrap">
      <table class="comparison-table">
        <caption class="sr-only">
          Comparativa de operativa entre emitir DeCA uno a uno o con DECA Light
        </caption>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col" class="col-metric"><span class="sr-only">Tarea</span></th>
            <th scope="col" class="col-manual">Uno a uno</th>
            <th scope="col" class="col-deca">DECA Light</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Formularios que rellenas</th>
            <td class="val-manual font-mono">40</td>
            <td class="val-deca font-mono">0</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Matrículas que tecleas</th>
            <td class="val-manual font-mono">40</td>
            <td class="val-deca font-mono">10</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Clics para emitir</th>
            <td class="val-manual font-mono">40</td>
            <td class="val-deca"><span class="font-mono">4</span>, uno por transportista</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <p class="comparison-note">
      Ejemplo: 40 cargas de 4 transportistas en 10 camiones.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .comparison-section {
    padding-top: 4.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 4.5rem;
    background-color: var(--color-bg-canvas, var(--palette-slate-50));
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle, var(--palette-slate-200));
  }

  .comparison-container {
    max-width: 900px;
  }

  .comparison-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
  }

  .comparison-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.625rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--color-text-primary, var(--palette-slate-900));
    margin: 0;
  }

  .comparison-table-wrap {
    width: 100%;
    background-color: var(--color-bg-surface, var(--palette-white));
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle, var(--palette-slate-200));
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 10px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .comparison-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .comparison-table thead th {
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle, var(--palette-slate-200));
  }

  .col-metric {
    width: 46%;
    color: var(--color-text-muted, var(--palette-slate-500));
  }

  .col-manual {
    width: 24%;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary, var(--palette-slate-600));
  }

  .col-deca {
    width: 30%;
    color: var(--color-brand-primary, var(--palette-emerald-700));
    background-color: var(--palette-emerald-50);
  }

  .comparison-table tbody th,
  .comparison-table tbody td {
    padding: 1.125rem 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle, var(--palette-slate-200));
  }

  .comparison-table tbody tr:last-child th,
  .comparison-table tbody tr:last-child td {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .comparison-table tbody th {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text-primary, var(--palette-slate-900));
  }

  .val-manual {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary, var(--palette-slate-600));
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .val-deca {
    background-color: rgba(236, 253, 245, 0.55);
    color: var(--palette-emerald-900);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .font-mono {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .comparison-note {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted, var(--palette-slate-500));
  }

  .sr-only {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    padding: 0;
    margin: -1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 639px) {
    .comparison-table thead th,
    .comparison-table tbody th,
    .comparison-table tbody td {
      padding: 0.875rem 0.75rem;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
    }
  }
</style>
